      "label": "性能係數",
      "kind": "definition",
      "summary": "熱泵或冰箱傳遞熱量與輸入功之比值。",
      "latex": "\\text{COP (heating)} = \\frac{|Q_h|}{W}, \\text{COP(cooling)} = \\frac{|Q_c|}{W}",
      "pages": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clausius-statement",
      "label": "克勞修斯定律",
      "kind": "law",
      "summary": "熱量不可能自發地從低溫物體傳遞到高溫物體，而不產生其他影響。",
      "latex": "",
      "pages": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "equivalence-kelvin-planck-clausius",
      "label": "克勞修斯與克耳文-普朗克等效性",
